 "description": "Get share/bond trading totals and daily_series. No dates = latest 30 days; both dates = range (yield_wavg and *_latest are null). Find the id with search_by_ticker. Example: {\"uuid\":\"a97f1fed\",\"date_from\":\"2026-06-01\",\"date_to\":\"2026-06-30\"}.",
